    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49792" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἶβις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑβ</span>, <i><span class="en">
