				<u>HA</u>
				617b27
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰβίων τροφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					3p.229
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
